   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Get the Point**: rare: 12 archived performances [5]\n- **Nashville to Kentucky**: back after 62 archived shows (1182 days) [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **MMJ2015-11-20._KM140** (recommended): source not stated; 21 songs; 127 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n- **mmj2015-11-20.dpa4023.flac16**: source not stated; 21 songs; 127 min [3]\n- **mmj2015-11-20.dpa4023.flac24**: source not stated; 21 songs; 127 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- A loud, drunken clapper in the left channel disrupted the recording [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **MMJ2015-11-20._KM140**: taped by Mike Camp; transferred by Mike Camp; source: AK40>LC3>KM100>M148>PMD660 (Oade) [1]\n- **mmj2015-11-20.dpa4023.flac16**: taped by John Lynch; transferred by Andy Murray; source: DPA 4023>Sonosax SX-M32>AD2K>Edirol R-44 (24bit/48khz) [3]. Also: Mics were DIN, transferred via USB to Macbook Pro and processed in Wave Editor [3]\n- **mmj2015-11-20.dpa4023.flac24**: taped by John Lynch; transferred by Andy Murray; source: DPA 4023>Sonosax SX-M32>AD2K>Edirol R-44 (24bit/48khz) [2]",
